Blink patch for lazymc, on top of master 204324f (July 2026).
Contains pull request #107 (status decoding for Paper) and Blink's own changes:
fast status polling while waking, no polling of a frozen server, graceful stop of a frozen server,
and a before_freeze hook. Apply: git checkout 204324f && git apply lazymc-blink.patch

